        "role": "user",
        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"69686e3d-f814-4a54-ab65-3fe4900620b6\",\"review_text\":\"Spotify is by far the best streaming service. I've had all of them. My girlfriend listened to nick Jonas so much, I made the top 1% in the country. Trust me, he is not my favorite. My top song was, Halsey. East side. Plus I was in the top 10% in how much I listen to Spotify. Over 3200 songs. Keep up the good work.\"},{\"review_id\":\"4ab68acc-abbe-402f-a5ff-f43640f78a32\",\"review_text\":\"😟\"},{\"review_id\":\"f1a66066-2291-4913-b79f-a66d769171b0\",\"review_text\":\"The worst app ever using this app since 3 year but now this app wants primium and cant even change music there is no 0 star this app doesn't deserve 1 star also 🤬\"},{\"review_id\":\"953e7671-1a6d-453b-af60-f28035b292ca\",\"review_text\":\"This app is asking to pay premium for everything ....not letting to play my fav songs and to skip songs ...nowadays its so worst to use this app\"},{\"review_id\":\"fe1f05ca-c231-4a0c-9576-fa71abd43e2c\",\"review_text\":\"It's just perfect for me. I wish they'd add audio books section as well to make it the ultimate listening app\"},{\"review_id\":\"e9a7546c-7ced-4016-a7e5-bd6914783ace\",\"review_text\":\"love it but please for the love of god get rid of the smart shuffle thing or like, make it a separate button cuz i'm just trying to reshuffle my playlist and it makes the process very annoying\"},{\"review_id\":\"be4ffc58-c9cc-4b37-83e8-aba9c63e8e51\",\"review_text\":\"All songs are not provided.\"},{\"review_id\":\"c747a3ba-29ec-4188-b5c3-38d662a84ae6\",\"review_text\":\"Good app just can not find away to turn shuffle play off\"},{\"review_id\":\"21870528-cf05-4039-a3ee-3c8999357463\",\"review_text\":\"Always aks primeam\"},{\"review_id\":\"8dc916ae-a482-45f3-a4bc-f5adc4242896\",\"review_text\":\"My world is full of songs 🎵 this is my confort place to listen 🎶 ❤ songs\"}]}"
